hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"385","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ishaq bin Musa Al-Ansari, qala: Haddasana Ma'n, haddasana Malik bin Anas, 'an Rabi'ah bin Abi 'Abdir-Rahman, 'an Anas bin Malik, annahu sami'ahu, yaqulu: Kana Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam, laysa bit-tawilil-ba'in, wa la bil-qasir, wa la bil-abyadil-amhaq, wa la bil-adam, wa la bil-ja'dil-qatat, wa la bis-sabit, ba'athahu Allahu ta'ala 'ala ra'si arba'ina sanah, fa-aqama bi-Makkata 'ashra sinin, wa bil-Madinah 'ashra sinin, wa tawaffahu Allahu 'ala ra'si sittina sanah, wa laysa fi ra'sihi wa lihyatihi 'ishruna sha'ratan bayda'. Haddasana Qutaybah bin Sa'id, 'an Malik bin Anas, 'an Rabi'ah bin Abi 'Abdir-Rahman, 'an Anas bin Malik, nahwah."
"386","[AI-translation] Haddasana Abu 'Ammar Al-Husayn bin Hurayth, wa Qutaybah bin Sa'id, wa ghayru wahid, qalu: Haddasana Sufyan bin 'Uyaynah, 'an Az-Zuhri, 'an Anas bin Malik, qala: Akhiru nazratin nazartuha ila Rasulillah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam, kashfus-sitarati yawmal-ithnayn, fa-nazartu ila wajhihi ka'annahu waraqata mushafin, wan-nasu khalfa Abi Bakr, fa-kadan-nasu an yadhtaribu, fa-ashara ilan-nasi anithbutu, wa Abu Bakr ya'ummuhum wa alqa-s-sijfa, wa tuwuffiya Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam min akhiri dhalikal-yawm."
"387","[AI-translation] Haddasana Humayd bin Mas'adah Al-Basri, qala: Haddasana Sulaym bin Akhdar, 'an Ibn 'Awn, 'an Ibrahim, 'an Al-Aswad, 'an 'A'ishah, qalat: Kuntu musnidatan-nabiyya sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam, ila sadri aw qalat: ila hijri fa-da'a bitastin li-yabula fihi, thumma bala, fa-mat."
"388","[AI-translation] Haddasana Qutaybah, haddasana Al-Layth, 'an Ibn Al-Had, 'an Musa bin Sarjis, 'an Al-Qasim bin Muhammad, 'an 'A'ishah, annaha qalat: Ra'aytu Rasulallah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam, wa huwa bil-mawti wa 'indahu qadahun fihi ma'un, wa huwa yudkhilu yadahu fil-qadah, thumma yamsahu wajhahu bil-ma', thumma yaqulu: Allahumma a'inni 'ala munkarat aw qala: 'ala sakaratil-mawt."
"389","[AI-translation] Haddasana Al-Hasan bin As-Sabbah Al-Bazzaz, qala: Haddasana Mubashshir bin Isma'il, 'an 'Abdir-Rahman bin Al-'Ala', 'an abihi, 'an Ibn 'Umar, 'an 'A'ishah, qalat: La aghbitu ahadan bi-hawni mawtin ba'dalladhi ra'aytu min shiddati mawti Rasulillah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam."
"390","[AI-translation] Hamein Abu Kuraib Muhammad bin Al-Ala ne hadith sunayi. Farmaya: Hamein Abu Muawiya ne hadith sunayi, unhein Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakr se (aur woh Ibn Al-Mulaiki hain), unhein Ibn Abi Mulaika se, unhein Aisha se. Farmati hain: Jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ka inteqal hua, to aap ke dafn karne mein ikhtilaf kiya gaya. Abu Bakr ne kaha: Maine Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se kuch suna hai jo main nahi bhoola. Aapne farmaya: Allah kisi Nabi ko us jagah ke siwa nahi uthata jis mein dafn hone ko woh pasand karta ho. Unhein unke bistar ki jagah par dafn karo."
"391","[AI-translation] Hamein Muhammad bin Bashshar, aur Ayyash Al-Anbari, aur Sawwar bin Abdullah, aur ghair wahid (kai log) ne hadith sunayi. Unhon ne kaha: Hamein Yahya bin Saeed ne khabar di, unhein Sufyan Al-Thawri se, unhein Musa bin Abi Aisha se, unhein Ubaidullah se, unhein Ibn Abbas aur Aisha se: Ke Abu Bakr ne Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko wafaat ke baad chuma."
